      "id": "2124713023315366003",
      "text": "\"We need to learn how to play with the lead.\" The final game of the #Oilers road trip saw them fall 5-4 in a shootout to the Blues after holding a 4-1 lead with five minutes left in regulation. Paige has your recap from St. Louis. @CIBC | #LetsGoOilers https://t.co/wbE7L1IHNw",
